Is orange the new black,
for rogues in Sporkhack?

Will a taste of Magicbane
drive the sleepy monsters insane?

First they're confused and stunned,
then they're scared and on the run.

It's a game of afflictions we play,
when we add pets to the melee.

Their panicked retreat
stops when a shade entreats.

I've heard other fellows
who shout stop the screams,
put on yellow.

But why waste a dragon,
when a scroll stops the nagging?

For power to weight it is true,
any dragon will do.

But when you're selective,
pick the hide that's most effective.

